SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 4 - Saving
 Cyrodiil Between Unnecessary Side Quests
DESCRIPTION:Cyrodiil is still in danger, the Oblivion Gates remain a
 problem, and the fate of the world may very well rest in our hands.
 Naturally, we've also got approximately seventeen unrelated errands to
 complete, several caves to investigate, and somebody in a nearby village
 who desperately needs help finding something they misplaced. Saving the
 world can wait five minutes. Probably. Return to the province of Cyrodiil
 in a remastered version of the legendary open-world RPG. With the Emperor
 slain and mysterious Oblivion Gates opening across the land, we'll create
 our character, explore towns and ancient ruins, take on quests, join
 factions, delve into dangerous dungeons and battle the forces of Mehrunes
 Dagon. Whether we follow the main story or get completely distracted by
 side quests, there's a huge fantasy world waiting to be rediscovered.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R-DfKEnDuPE
CATEGORIES:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-25052211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261016T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261112T134200Z
DTSTART:20261106T213000Z
DTEND:20261106T233000Z
SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 24 - We Escaped the Law Just to Find
 Another Man's War
DESCRIPTION:Arthur Morgan rides again as our Red Dead Redemption II
 adventure reaches Episode 24. Escaping the law should have been a welcome
 opportunity to enjoy some peace and quiet, but apparently we've managed to
 find ourselves caught up in somebody else's conflict instead. Different
 place, different problems, same extraordinary talent for attracting
 trouble. Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde Gang are outlaws on the run.
 With federal agents and bounty hunters massing on their heels, the gang
 must rob, steal, and fight their way across the rugged heartland in order
 to survive.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o03Fm7begOs
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
