LAST-MODIFIED:20261112T134200Z
DTSTART:20261112T213000Z
DTEND:20261112T233000Z
SUMMARY:Velvet Assassin | Ep. 2 - It's a House of God, Lads. Keep the
 Screaming Down.
DESCRIPTION:Cereza and Cheshire return to the mysterious forest for
 another evening of magical exploration, puzzles, beautiful environments,
 and encounters with strange creatures. At this point, I'm beginning to
 suspect Cheshire thinks we're running some sort of supernatural animal
 rescue centre. We're not. We barely have room for the creatures we've
 already met. Step into the shadows of World War II as British secret agent
 Violette Summer in this dark and atmospheric stealth adventure inspired by
 the story of real-life agent Violette Szabo. Deep behind enemy lines,
 we'll infiltrate heavily guarded locations, sabotage enemy operations and
 use darkness to remain unseen while silently dealing with anyone standing
 in our way. With missions unfolding through Violette's feverish memories
 from a hospital bed, surreal environments and a strong focus on stealth,
 patience and timing, we'll see if we have what it takes to survive some
 extremely dangerous assignments.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Velvet Assassin
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
