SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 25 - Sadie Adler's Got a Plan. God
 Help the Poor Bastards Involved.
DESCRIPTION:Arthur Morgan returns as our Red Dead Redemption II journey
 reaches Episode 25, and this time Sadie Adler has a plan. Anyone familiar
 with Sadie will understand why that should immediately set alarm bells
 ringing. Whatever she's got in mind, there's a reasonable chance it'll
 involve danger, gunfire, and somebody having a particularly unpleasant
 afternoon. Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde Gang are outlaws on the
 run. With federal agents and bounty hunters massing on their heels, the
 gang must rob, steal, and fight their way across the rugged heartland in
 order to survive.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
